### Регистрация
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Сергей Сидоров",
  "email": "sergey@example.com",
  "password": "secret12345"
}

### Логин
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sergey@example.com",
  "password": "secret12345"
}

